{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_title", "source_sha256": "2048b3a6ca834bb4fd91d89e2d77da5759144b2c648539845e586c0d672aa710", "ja": "知性＝女子力！", "zh": "知性＝女子力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fb87d9dbafc3f4502da210b9e4d1f77b39670aa3aa244e701f898e77205f0b99", "ja": "『CLEVER CLOVER』の集大成ライブが\n無事終わり、喜ぶ星梨花、ロコ、あずさ、\n海美。ツアーを通して知性、つまり女子力\nが上がったかもとはしゃぐ海美。続きはお茶\nを飲みながらと、飲食店へ向かうのだった。", "zh": "“CLEVER CLOVER”的集大成演出\n圆满落幕，星梨花、ROCO、梓和\n海美都沉浸在喜悦中。海美兴奋地表示，\n通过巡演自己的知性，也就是女子力或许有所提升。\n于是大家决定边喝茶边聊，动身前往了餐饮店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "829dfd9389563412b7fec920366126318ae1e311f288490538bfc254123d389b", "ja": "（CLEVER CLOVERの集大成ライブが終わった。\nみんな、本当によく頑張ってくれたな！）", "zh": "（CLEVER CLOVER的最终公演结束了。\n大家真的都很努力啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "4863dd331e84de20690761f8d4bad19d1e71fb5f450c86790f2567e7aa076ac9", "ja": "すっごく盛り上がりましたね！\nわたしたちのライブ、成功ですよね……？", "zh": "现场气氛特别热烈呢！我们的演唱会，算是成功了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "893545fb94bd5e6dce77f5105c502287aa1b9b29d05d274eca8ea1c883fc5484", "ja": "オフコースです！　会場で聞いた拍手が、\n動かぬエビデンスですよ、セリカ♪", "zh": "当然啦！现场听到的掌声，\n就是不容置疑的证据哦，星梨花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "eda3e8ad97579701ac7c850dc36bd3a70e537c8205ba282fbe70d7206ed9806d", "ja": "劇場から離れた場所にも、エクスプレッションが\n届いた……ロコにとっても大きなステップです！", "zh": "连剧场之外的地方，也传达到了这份表现力……对ROCO来说也是一大步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "8c8eeabf1b07eaef14e3c27020e307cad79283f0c467b540018e571ede7d7187", "ja": "英知を象徴するチームだなんて言われて、\n少し緊張したけど……なんとか、果たせたかしら？", "zh": "被称为象征智慧的团队，\n虽然有点紧张……不知道算是完成了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "6b2155f6396efe42dc70f207861cfddc69105c931a69c2609952f21612dfb9bb", "ja": "私は、いつもどおり頑張るだけだったけど……ハッ！\nツアーで、知性っぽいのが育ったのかも！？", "zh": "我只是像平时一样努力而已……哈！\n说不定在巡演中，培养出了点知性的感觉！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0abd72ebd3b6eded7fc0bacfce42c303af3f948b5a0ba763b7d5dbde338e91e2", "ja": "そうだな……後で、皆で振り返ってみるといいと思う。\nツアーならではの気付きや、発見も多いだろうし。", "zh": "是啊……我觉得之后大家一起回顾一下会比较好。\n毕竟，巡演中应该也会有许多只有巡演才能体会到的感悟和发现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "b91ac69708db84c5c5d4e1e793ab8c6b744b09f2fe09ae2bd49a24ce799193ba", "ja": "知性がアップしたなら、女子力も急上昇だよね！\nう～、テンションあがってきたーっ☆", "zh": "智力提升了的话，女子力也会跟着飞速上涨吧！\n呜～，我越来越兴奋了——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d1508d405711a2910974cf1fec6e35d73aa27689d84398831c51f89bf4234653", "ja": "え？　そ、それはどうだろう……。というか、\nだから皆で振り返ってみようという話で……。", "zh": "诶？这、这个嘛……可不好说……。话说回来，\n所以才说要大家一起回顾一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "26452e241d3c81c476d131cddde20c6ea3619263ba63c1f6046f89616d777a31", "ja": "そうですね。出発まで、まだ時間もありますし……\nみんなで、お茶でも飲みながら振り返りましょうか？", "zh": "是啊。离出发还有些时间……\n要不要大家一起喝杯茶，回顾一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "ee430d2a785860539a63ad842e78f80484c14b77d62bb2e38a31acb62bcaeec4", "ja": "賛成です！　駅の近くならお店もたくさんありますし、\n迷子になりませんよね♪", "zh": "我赞成！车站附近有很多店，也不会迷路，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "b1314c28299434d6e5ebc0f21b2a3a168ae2a1759cb0904190388562adb6dc92", "ja": "たしか地下に、レストラン街がありましたよ！\nフードカルチャーのチェックも欠かせません！", "zh": "我记得地下好像有一片美食街哦！  \n美食文化也不能错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "709a0e68bc636e08e17f82af4f111bd6d5d7b272f80f264119e958ae14c2beaa", "ja": "ツアー中に食べた仙台の食べ物、どれも\nおいしかったです！　お土産も買えるかな……？", "zh": "巡演期间吃到的仙台美食，每一样\n都很好吃！不知道能不能买到伴手礼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "fae437fac50cfaa7cb8ca5ca2808331880b374cd490a935f2851d13994d5f72f", "ja": "それじゃ、話の続きはお店でね！\nみんな、いくよーっ☆", "zh": "那么，接下来的话就去店里聊吧！大家，出发啦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi01_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "d267ad2facb064e1bdb0f6b720bde1112eb965df71a4a7f877acd11fbf7e43be", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく……\n{$P$}さんも、早く早く♪", "zh": "那么，马上就……{$P$}先生也快点快点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
